WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:04.960
Salvation, Indiana was your typical, midwestern
American town.

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:09.030
The kind of place where everyone knew each
other, where everyone was comfortable leaving

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:13.519
their doors unlocked at night, where there
was a sense of trust between neighbors that

00:00:13.519 --> 00:00:16.619
you couldn’t find in a more populated area.

00:00:16.619 --> 00:00:21.130
The kind of place where word traveled fast,
and where people talked about things that

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:25.399
were improper in hushed voices, behind the
backs of others.

00:00:25.399 --> 00:00:30.589
In Salvation, being an outsider or deviating
from the norm was akin to complete isolation.

00:00:30.589 --> 00:00:33.440
You either fit in, or you got out.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:39.010
And if you didn’t, Salvation had its ways
of making you conform to the mold.

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:43.420
Gossip, organized stalking efforts, discrimination.

00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:48.220
These small-town methods were often employed
by the town’s inner circle to keep those

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:51.100
who they had a distaste for in check.

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:56.920
And unfortunately, this cliquish mentality
can be the norm when it comes to small towns.

00:00:56.920 --> 00:01:01.329
There’s nothing anomalous about the ugliness
of human nature.

00:01:01.329 --> 00:01:04.350
But Salvation did have its secrets.

00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:08.850
The kind that, if brought to light, would
tear a small town apart.

00:01:08.850 --> 00:01:13.479
The kind that attracted the attention of the
US government’s Unusual Incidents Unit,

00:01:13.479 --> 00:01:19.509
a branch of the Federal Bureau of Investigation
that dealt with the paranormal and supernatural.

00:01:19.509 --> 00:01:23.869
The US Government’s answer to the SCP Foundation.

00:01:23.869 --> 00:01:30.549
Between June 18th and June 23rd, 1976, the
town of Salvation Indiana underwent swaths

00:01:30.549 --> 00:01:36.329
of extreme anomalous activity that affected
the town’s entire population, but was mainly

00:01:36.329 --> 00:01:41.649
centered around Salvation’s high school,
appropriately named, well, Salvation High

00:01:41.649 --> 00:01:42.649
School.

00:01:42.649 --> 00:01:47.569
Two UIU agents were dispatched to Salvation
to assess the reports of anomalous activity,

00:01:47.569 --> 00:01:51.100
record it, and of course, help cover it up.

00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:55.959
This was one of the few times the UIU got
the jump on an anomalous incident before a

00:01:55.959 --> 00:02:01.649
larger, more prominent organization such as
the SCP Foundation or the Global Occult Coalition

00:02:01.649 --> 00:02:04.920
. Bet they got a company pizza party for that
one.

00:02:04.920 --> 00:02:09.690
The operation went smoothly, with the agents
using an early amnestic, labeled CHEMICAL

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:14.350
110 to wipe the memories of the townsfolk
after interviewing them.

00:02:14.350 --> 00:02:19.250
Although in later years, study of CHEMICAL
110 would prove it to be incredibly dangerous,

00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:25.540
as the amnestic was both toxic and had a degrading,
damaging effect on human memory centers.

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:29.530
Between this and the Foundation’s early
amnestic models also proving to be incredibly

00:02:29.530 --> 00:02:35.280
dangerous, the 1970s were an interesting time
indeed in the field of supernatural coverup

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:36.560
operations.

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:40.460
The timeline of events the agents established
depicted an eerie scene.

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:45.680
It was only a few days, but what occurred
was both horrifying and strange.

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:50.750
On Sunday night, 10th-grade students at Salvation
High School reported hearing what they described

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:56.300
as “someone trying to speak under the ground”
while passing by the school on their way home

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:57.930
from a church service.

00:02:57.930 --> 00:03:01.720
One student reported it to her mother, who
ignored it entirely.

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:06.560
On Monday, an 11th-grade student of Salvation
High School claimed during gym class that

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:10.380
he could hear voices coming from underneath
the school’s pool.

00:03:10.380 --> 00:03:12.750
Several other students corroborated this story.

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:17.250
When school officials came to investigate,
they didn’t find anything unusual.

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:22.070
But the UIU agents found that the lining at
the bottom of the pool was cracked.

00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:27.270
On the same day, several female students reported
seeing “faceless things” instead of their

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:30.080
own reflections in a bathroom mirror.

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:32.520
They did not seem bothered by this.

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:36.520
During lunch announcements, many students
described being able to hear a third voice

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:41.080
alongside the two other students speaking
unintelligibly below the broadcast.

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:46.570
Curiously, the agents found that the PA room,
where the broadcast originated from, sat in

00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:48.780
a media center near the pool.

00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:53.350
On Tuesday, students arriving at school noticed
that the Indiana state flag was more than

00:03:53.350 --> 00:03:59.180
three meters above the top of the flagpole,
attached to nothing, just floating.

00:03:59.180 --> 00:04:01.480
The American flag was not found.

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:06.000
And more importantly, the students claimed
they could see nine female figures hanging

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:11.250
by ropes from the flagpole, who disappeared
immediately after being seen.

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:15.130
During a biology class, one student suddenly
stood up, and rolled their eyes to the back

00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:16.130
of their head.

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:20.220
They descended suddenly into the floor and
disappeared entirely.

00:04:20.220 --> 00:04:24.120
Shortly after, they reappeared above a ceiling
panel in the corner of the room.

00:04:24.120 --> 00:04:28.840
No other students were able to identify the
student, and several of their classmates insisted

00:04:28.840 --> 00:04:31.200
that their actions were just a joke.

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:35.300
The UIU agents were unable to find proof of
the student’s existence in Salvation’s

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:36.940
enrollment records.

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:40.990
Similarly, students described yet another
student they didn’t recognize, walking the

00:04:40.990 --> 00:04:42.790
halls of the high school.

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:47.410
They were unable to define any details of
their appearance, save for one thing that

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:52.570
stood out: they wore a purple satchel with
the word “syncope” embroidered on the

00:04:52.570 --> 00:04:53.570
side.

00:04:53.570 --> 00:04:57.530
A custodian reported seeing something staring
at him, standing at the bottom of the school

00:04:57.530 --> 00:04:58.530
pool.

00:04:58.530 --> 00:05:02.919
On Wednesday, the horror only sped up, as
school staff noted that there was a full two

00:05:02.919 --> 00:05:06.300
inches of water across all levels of the school.

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:09.870
For whatever reason, the school’s principal
decided not to close the school.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:16.450
At 7:56 AM, the entirety of the student body
heard an unknown voice whisper the word “hello”

00:05:16.450 --> 00:05:18.669
in their right ear.

00:05:18.669 --> 00:05:22.720
Members of the school band realized their
instruments no longer produced any sound,

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:27.710
but whenever they played, they reported seeing
a small, black, human-shaped entity flickering

00:05:27.710 --> 00:05:31.960
in and out of view in the corner of the room,
facing the wall.

00:05:31.960 --> 00:05:36.360
One student saw a dark figure walking up and
away from the school through the air at an

00:05:36.360 --> 00:05:37.610
impossible angle.

00:05:37.610 --> 00:05:42.140
Eventually, the figure disappeared from her
sight and was never seen again.

00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:44.310
No other student addressed this.

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:48.860
On Thursday, a student in gym class avoided
a dodgeball as it phased through his body.

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:51.820
He sunk into the floor, screaming for help.

00:05:51.820 --> 00:05:54.830
Nobody who noticed seemed motivated enough
to help him.

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:59.210
The entire school shifted roughly one foot
off of its foundations at 11 AM.

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:03.490
The vice-principal, who was sent to inspect
the building’s integrity, described seeing,

00:06:03.490 --> 00:06:08.680
“something small, with too many faces”
grinning at him from underneath the building

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:13.169
before the school inexplicably resettled back
to its original position.

00:06:13.169 --> 00:06:17.820
The boys' locker rooms disappeared, and were
replaced with what witnesses described as

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:19.830
“something that screamed”.

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:22.330
They were unable to provide any details.

00:06:22.330 --> 00:06:27.020
As the students left for the day, they saw
nine young women hanging in the air, tilted

00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:29.870
forward at an angle above the school’s parking
lot.

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:34.080
They could be seen silently mouthing words,
and their appearances were described by witnesses

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:35.910
as “ugly” and ”unremarkable”.

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:40.930
They vanished, and again the majority of the
town’s residents report hearing a child's

00:06:40.930 --> 00:06:45.510
voice say the word “hello” below them
upon the figure's disappearance.

00:06:45.510 --> 00:06:49.990
A panic ensued, as town officials had no explanation
for these events.

00:06:49.990 --> 00:06:53.690
Salvation’s principal made the call to close
the school on Friday.

00:06:53.690 --> 00:06:58.770
However, when Friday morning arrived, the
entire student body showed up for school.

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:03.419
The building was locked, so the students simply
waited outside to be let in.

00:07:03.419 --> 00:07:05.551
No individuals could describe why they were
there.

00:07:05.551 --> 00:07:10.900
There was a knock on a window, and the students
saw a small, black entity standing outside

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:12.680
of a second-story classroom.

00:07:12.680 --> 00:07:18.730
The entity phased in and out of the school’s
windows over and over, until suddenly disappearing.

00:07:18.730 --> 00:07:22.680
After this, the front door unlocked itself,
and the mass gathering of students entered

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:23.680
the building.

00:07:23.680 --> 00:07:28.650
However, what they found was unlike the small
school they had come to know over the years.

00:07:28.650 --> 00:07:34.850
Inside, Salvation High school was transformed
into a non-euclidean space, meaning that reality

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:37.510
didn’t work inside it the way it should.

00:07:37.510 --> 00:07:40.500
Hallways that led right instead led downward.

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:43.050
Stairs that went up instead curved left.

00:07:43.050 --> 00:07:46.400
As the students moved through the school,
they couldn’t help but feel like they were

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:48.180
always moving down.

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:50.010
Lower and lower.

00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:53.479
Some heard whispers, others heard drums in
the distance.

00:07:53.479 --> 00:07:57.580
As they approached the basement, they saw
a massive, stone archway.

00:07:57.580 --> 00:08:02.680
Suddenly, the students shifted, encasing the
entire group in rock and earth for twenty

00:08:02.680 --> 00:08:03.710
seconds.

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:08.410
After this brief, suffocating torture ended,
the students reappeared back in the school,

00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:12.790
except this time, every one of them reported
being the only one in the building.

00:08:12.790 --> 00:08:16.639
They described the experience, wandering the
building alone before coming to what they

00:08:16.639 --> 00:08:22.670
called a “doorway below a doorway”, and
ending up inside a small sub-basement room.

00:08:22.670 --> 00:08:25.669
There they saw three mysterious visions.

00:08:25.669 --> 00:08:29.880
A woman crouched over a body of water, surrounded
and covered in blood.

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:35.060
A farmhouse in a group of trees that were
burning, nine white humanoid figures floated

00:08:35.060 --> 00:08:36.830
in the air overhead.

00:08:36.830 --> 00:08:41.580
A weeping woman digging in a field until her
hands began to rot and fall apart.

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:45.610
When these visions subsided, the black entity
reappeared again.

00:08:45.610 --> 00:08:49.580
It whispered “hello”, and the group of
students were suddenly surrounded by nine

00:08:49.580 --> 00:08:52.020
screaming female figures.

00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:56.390
After this, the students reappeared inside
their own homes.

00:08:56.390 --> 00:09:00.740
It was at this point that the UIU began to
enter the town to distribute amnestics to

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:02.130
the subjects.

00:09:02.130 --> 00:09:05.710
More anomalous activity was recorded in rapid
succession.

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:07.450
Bodies hanging in the sky.

00:09:07.450 --> 00:09:11.250
Water taps leak human hair and mucus instead
of water.

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:15.360
Individuals reported that their facial features
had disappeared entirely.

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:18.190
Others reported seeing faceless creatures
in the town.

00:09:18.190 --> 00:09:22.220
The black entity frantically appearing and
reappearing in rapid succession throughout

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:23.420
the town.

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:28.410
Even a weeping young woman running back into
the school building, who witnesses lost after

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:30.580
she entered the school’s basement.

00:09:30.580 --> 00:09:33.610
The cover-up effort was brutal, but it worked.

00:09:33.610 --> 00:09:37.740
The townspeople of Salvation were convinced
that they saw hallucinations as a result of

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:41.250
toxic gasses blown south from a factory up
north.

00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:45.000
But what was the connection between all the
phenomena?

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:47.560
Nine faceless, female entities.

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:49.120
Water and blood.

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:52.950
Something that literally upsets the entire
foundation of Salvation High School.

00:09:52.950 --> 00:09:54.300
A small, black entity.

00:09:54.300 --> 00:09:59.770
Adults in the town ignoring the things their
children saw, and acting indifferent toward

00:09:59.770 --> 00:10:00.770
them.

00:10:00.770 --> 00:10:05.990
All of this sounds a lot like a dirty, dark
secret being unearthed in the town of Salvation.

00:10:05.990 --> 00:10:09.420
Something people would rather turn a blind
eye to and ignore.

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:10.750
But they couldn’t.

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:13.170
Because the terror was only getting started.

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:18.100
A week after these events occurred, contractors
assessing the damage to the school discovered

00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:23.390
the sub-basement room, where the students
had various visions of anomalous entities.

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:27.190
Behind it, was the entrance that led to the
large, stone archway.

00:10:27.190 --> 00:10:31.180
This antechamber was discovered after one
of the members of the contracting team slipped

00:10:31.180 --> 00:10:36.770
and fell beneath a collapsed section of wall
and floor that led to the massive area underneath

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:37.790
the school.

00:10:37.790 --> 00:10:42.330
The contracting team attempted to extract
them, but they did not succeed.

00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:46.760
Their disappearance caught the attention of
the SCP Foundation, who assessed the school

00:10:46.760 --> 00:10:51.300
and deemed the area beneath the school to
be anomalous, as the building’s architecture

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:54.430
should not be able to accommodate the size
of the area.

00:10:54.430 --> 00:11:01.300
It was designated SCP-3935, and as the Foundation
began investigating it, they were determined

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:05.740
to uncover the truth of what was really occurring
in Salvation, Indiana.

00:11:05.740 --> 00:11:12.320
While exploring SCP-3935, they came across
the stone archway, a piece of architecture

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:14.720
whose origins are unknown.

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:16.690
Inscribed on the arch was a phrase that read:

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:23.899
“The way below winds deeper, longer,
Unspeakable its patterns laid

00:11:23.899 --> 00:11:31.020
The lost forever, damned to wander
This thing a quiet madness made.”

00:11:31.020 --> 00:11:36.750
After the initial establishment of SCP-3935
as an anomalous location, the Foundation poured

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:42.959
deeper into Salvation’s mystery and came
across the documents created by the UIU agents.

00:11:42.959 --> 00:11:47.650
The Foundation, being much more thorough in
their containment methods than the UIU, decided

00:11:47.650 --> 00:11:53.111
that the small town of 1,400 people was easy
enough to relocate entirely, and the entire

00:11:53.111 --> 00:11:58.760
area could be condemned, feeding into the
excuse of a hazardous waste facility nearby

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:03.000
leaking noxious gasses into the town’s water
and air supply.

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:07.480
With the townsfolk successfully relocated,
Salvation was quarantined and cut off from

00:12:07.480 --> 00:12:08.990
the rest of the world.

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:14.519
Roads were removed and rerouted, and Foundation
personnel turned over any trespassers to local

00:12:14.519 --> 00:12:15.740
authorities.

00:12:15.740 --> 00:12:22.240
Salvation High School became a hub for Foundation
researchers studying SCP-3935 and the events

00:12:22.240 --> 00:12:27.010
that occurred in the town, and the building
was heavily guarded when not in use by the

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:28.010
organization.

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:34.750
The initial exploration attempt into SCP-3935
was conducted by a team of Foundation agents,

00:12:34.750 --> 00:12:37.670
shortly after members of the contracting team
were lost.

00:12:37.670 --> 00:12:42.480
There was a slight hope they could be recovered,
and the effort was dubbed a search and rescue

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:43.480
mission.

00:12:43.480 --> 00:12:50.100
Three agents, Ellis, Porter, and Haskel, were
tasked with entering SCP-3935, all equipped

00:12:50.100 --> 00:12:53.589
with recording equipment and a shoulder-mounted
lamp system.

00:12:53.589 --> 00:12:57.690
They entered a cramped, narrow space beyond
the archway, where the subterranean stone

00:12:57.690 --> 00:13:02.570
walls got tighter and tighter, and the air
felt stuffy and uneasy.

00:13:02.570 --> 00:13:06.899
On the walls, images resembling a child’s
drawings were carved into the rock.

00:13:06.899 --> 00:13:11.570
As the team continued to push through the
rock tunnel, they found it difficult to breathe.

00:13:11.570 --> 00:13:14.600
The walls were getting narrower, too close
for comfort.

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:18.240
Suddenly, Porter’s voice cut out, and his
camera feed went black.

00:13:18.240 --> 00:13:23.270
When it came back, it appeared to be looking
up at two sources of light, most likely the

00:13:23.270 --> 00:13:27.270
other two agent’s lamps, as Porter fell
from a great distance.

00:13:27.270 --> 00:13:31.630
His screaming was heard, on both the cameras
and by the other agents, but they couldn’t

00:13:31.630 --> 00:13:32.900
figure out where he was.

00:13:32.900 --> 00:13:38.030
Ellis and Haskel began to panic, moving faster
and attempting to struggle forward.

00:13:38.030 --> 00:13:42.830
The rock tunnel was so tight, so constraining,
that they were unable to move more than a

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:44.950
few steps in a second.

00:13:44.950 --> 00:13:50.130
After a short period of time, both men fell
forward into a larger, open space.

00:13:50.130 --> 00:13:54.120
As they searched for Porter, who wasn’t
behind them, they came to the conclusion that

00:13:54.120 --> 00:13:57.980
he must have fallen into a ravine or slipped
beneath the rocks.

00:13:57.980 --> 00:14:01.620
There was no other explanation for how he
disappeared so suddenly.

00:14:01.620 --> 00:14:05.550
But their talk was cut short when they realized
what was in front of them.

00:14:05.550 --> 00:14:10.130
They hadn’t noticed it at first, but when
they turned their lamps forward, they noticed

00:14:10.130 --> 00:14:14.370
a gigantic structure, seemingly carved out
of stone.

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:18.000
It resembled Salvation High school, almost
perfectly.

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:21.020
The main entrance was visible, and the windows
too.

00:14:21.020 --> 00:14:26.459
A stone replica of the school, hidden in this
massive, underground area.

00:14:26.459 --> 00:14:28.110
The agents couldn’t believe it.

00:14:28.110 --> 00:14:32.120
There was a thick layer of fog in front of
them, but they could make out a narrow stone

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:38.279
bridge that extended across a large chasm,
leading to the stone replica of the school.

00:14:38.279 --> 00:14:42.420
As they examined further, they noticed that
underneath the school was another model of

00:14:42.420 --> 00:14:43.420
the school.

00:14:43.420 --> 00:14:45.180
And under that one was another.

00:14:45.180 --> 00:14:51.019
It went on indefinitely, extending deeper
and deeper into the ground, in the direction

00:14:51.019 --> 00:14:55.329
that all things in Salvation seemed to go
- down.

00:14:55.329 --> 00:15:00.959
On the other side of the bridge, hanging mid-air,
were nine female entities, their faces obscured

00:15:00.959 --> 00:15:02.769
by long white hair.

00:15:02.769 --> 00:15:05.329
The two agents stood still in fear.

00:15:05.329 --> 00:15:10.470
After a short time, the figures appeared ten
meters backwards, and then another ten, and

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:14.510
then they appeared right in front of the door
of the stone school structure.

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:19.261
Slowly, they lifted their heads, revealing
their featureless faces to the agents, who

00:15:19.261 --> 00:15:21.120
recoiled in fear.

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:23.010
After that, they disappeared.

00:15:23.010 --> 00:15:28.220
The two agents debated going back for reinforcements,
but they pushed onward after hearing the sudden

00:15:28.220 --> 00:15:32.050
sound of many voices speaking in hushed tones
in the distance.

00:15:32.050 --> 00:15:35.930
It could have been the lost contractors, or
their lost man, Porter.

00:15:35.930 --> 00:15:38.529
They entered the stone school and began searching.

00:15:38.529 --> 00:15:41.950
Inside, they couldn’t make heads or tails
of the architecture.

00:15:41.950 --> 00:15:46.279
As they ran down the hallways, following the
sound of the voices, they noticed that the

00:15:46.279 --> 00:15:48.339
halls seemed to stretch on forever.

00:15:48.339 --> 00:15:53.300
But they didn’t seem to notice the watching,
featureless faces, who observed the agents

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:56.040
from the window panes in the doorways.

00:15:56.040 --> 00:16:00.950
As the agents came to the auditorium doorway,
Agent Haskel let out a scream, and his voice

00:16:00.950 --> 00:16:02.780
recorder disconnected.

00:16:02.780 --> 00:16:07.089
At this point, what occurred became nearly
impossible to make out on the Foundation’s

00:16:07.089 --> 00:16:08.089
recording.

00:16:08.089 --> 00:16:09.089
The voices grew louder.

00:16:09.089 --> 00:16:12.210
Haskel’s camera shifted perspective to the
floor.

00:16:12.210 --> 00:16:17.240
Nine female entities appeared around Agent
Ellis, contorting their bodies into impossible

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:18.320
positions.

00:16:18.320 --> 00:16:20.820
Haskel ran, but the entities pursued him.

00:16:20.820 --> 00:16:22.240
He screamed for help.

00:16:22.240 --> 00:16:25.360
Eventually, the figures hung in the air, unmoving.

00:16:25.360 --> 00:16:29.690
Haskel slowed down too, and slowly turned
around, coming face to face with the small,

00:16:29.690 --> 00:16:34.220
black humanoid entity sitting upside down
on the ceiling of the hallway.

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:36.499
It whispered one word, “Hello”.

00:16:36.499 --> 00:16:39.830
The feed cut out to the choppy sounds of audio
distortion.

00:16:39.830 --> 00:16:41.519
A snapping noise was heard.

00:16:41.519 --> 00:16:43.380
And then, silence.

00:16:43.380 --> 00:16:45.960
And then, all three agents’ feeds returned.

00:16:45.960 --> 00:16:50.910
For the duration of the exploration recording,
Haskel, Ellis, and Porter lost their minds

00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:54.010
in the depths of SCP-3935.

00:16:54.010 --> 00:16:58.980
In between periods of silence, they laughed,
screamed, and shouted incoherently.

00:16:58.980 --> 00:17:02.960
Rambling on about how dark it is, and how
they can’t go down any further.

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:03.960
Below.

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:04.960
Below.

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:05.960
Where it goes on forever.

00:17:05.960 --> 00:17:07.801
Where they can be a part of the nine.

00:17:07.801 --> 00:17:09.470
Be a part of Salvation.

00:17:09.470 --> 00:17:11.419
Where they can fall forever.

00:17:11.419 --> 00:17:13.530
And after that, silence.

00:17:13.530 --> 00:17:19.309
The feed was cut out completely, and neither
the trio, nor the contractors, were ever recovered.

00:17:19.309 --> 00:17:23.610
After this failed, horrifying exploration
attempt, more anomalous activity occurred

00:17:23.610 --> 00:17:26.579
in the town during the Foundation’s occupation.

00:17:26.579 --> 00:17:30.660
Sightings of the nine faceless entities in
the streets and the trees.

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:34.940
An agent who saw the black figure constantly
in his peripheral vision.

00:17:34.940 --> 00:17:39.750
Sounds coming from a grove of trees near the
school, which led to a cabin and nine corpses

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:43.090
of former Salvation high school students in
the backyard.

00:17:43.090 --> 00:17:47.960
But before they could investigate, the female
entities appeared once more, and they were

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:50.430
unable to locate the grove again.

00:17:50.430 --> 00:17:54.640
The Foundation’s investigation of Salvation
continued throughout the decades, interviewing

00:17:54.640 --> 00:17:57.820
former staff members of the school and residents.

00:17:57.820 --> 00:18:01.590
They were trying to piece together any semblance
of a coherent story.

00:18:01.590 --> 00:18:06.700
To find a way to connect all of these dissonant
elements into something understandable.

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:12.990
The black figure, the corpses, the buried
secrets, and the nine female entities.

00:18:12.990 --> 00:18:15.000
How did it all connect to the school?

00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:20.900
In 2002, a Foundation agent interviewed Mrs.
Fletcher, an English teacher at Salvation

00:18:20.900 --> 00:18:25.780
High School during the period of anomalous
activity in 1976.

00:18:25.780 --> 00:18:28.150
The interview started out ordinarily enough.

00:18:28.150 --> 00:18:31.160
Fletcher, in her old age, couldn’t remember
much.

00:18:31.160 --> 00:18:34.340
She remembered the town was quiet, with a
tight-knit community.

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:38.200
They didn’t even need a police force because
there was so little crime.

00:18:38.200 --> 00:18:42.330
She remembered students would go into the
woods and chase ghosts, or claim they saw

00:18:42.330 --> 00:18:45.179
things, but it was never anything too strange.

00:18:45.179 --> 00:18:50.240
But as Fletcher continued to talk, she let
her mind wander more and more.

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:53.050
She recounted how there was a disappearance
at the High School.

00:18:53.050 --> 00:18:55.950
A girl who was last seen by the school’s
pool.

00:18:55.950 --> 00:18:57.990
The town assumed she ran away.

00:18:57.990 --> 00:19:02.220
After all, there were some individuals who
held strong opinions in Salvation.

00:19:02.220 --> 00:19:06.290
The kind of opinions that didn’t sit right
with some of the younger residents.

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:09.170
The church was important in Salvation.

00:19:09.170 --> 00:19:10.640
Nearly everyone went.

00:19:10.640 --> 00:19:12.050
Fletcher opened up some more.

00:19:12.050 --> 00:19:13.960
There was a scandal, she recalled.

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:18.560
A teenage girl on the school cheer team who
ended up pregnant out of wedlock.

00:19:18.560 --> 00:19:22.419
She couldn’t recall her name, or what she
looked like, but she remembered the town’s

00:19:22.419 --> 00:19:24.830
inner circle was in an uproar about it.

00:19:24.830 --> 00:19:26.470
She didn’t want them to know.

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:28.110
She didn’t want anyone to know.

00:19:28.110 --> 00:19:31.400
It was a secret she could barely keep from
spreading.

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:34.040
It must have been destroying her, Fletcher
explained.

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:35.950
She couldn’t remember much else about the
girl.

00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:39.820
But she did remember that the girl would always
say “hello” to her.

00:19:39.820 --> 00:19:41.570
Too many times, in fact.

00:19:41.570 --> 00:19:46.530
Eventually, the girl was found hanging in
the woods, right outside of a log cabin.

00:19:46.530 --> 00:19:50.480
They found a note in her hand, which contained
a drawing of a building that resembled the

00:19:50.480 --> 00:19:56.280
High School, and on its back the repetition
of the same word, over and over again, but

00:19:56.280 --> 00:19:58.710
Fletcher couldn’t recall what word it was.

00:19:58.710 --> 00:20:02.910
The Foundation agent was about to close the
interview out, but he had one last thing to

00:20:02.910 --> 00:20:03.910
ask.

00:20:03.910 --> 00:20:07.530
He produced a picture of the unidentified
nine female figures that were haunting the

00:20:07.530 --> 00:20:09.570
town and showed it to Fletcher.

00:20:09.570 --> 00:20:11.990
She became noticeably pale and short of breath.

00:20:11.990 --> 00:20:14.780
“Do you know anything about this, Mrs. Fletcher?”

00:20:14.780 --> 00:20:15.950
the agent said.

00:20:15.950 --> 00:20:20.179
She collected herself and examined the image
as best as she could, her hand shaking.

00:20:20.179 --> 00:20:22.179
“Well… yes, I do.

00:20:22.179 --> 00:20:25.299
Those are the, uh- that's the cheerleaders.

00:20:25.299 --> 00:20:29.660
There were, uh, well, let me think…

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:32.220
there were ten of them, though, I think.

00:20:32.220 --> 00:20:35.929
Unless something happened to one of them,
there were definitely ten.”

00:20:35.929 --> 00:20:39.030
The Foundation didn’t have to ask what happened
to the tenth.

00:20:39.030 --> 00:20:47.129
Now go check out “SCP-1337 - The Hitchhiker”
and “Revenge of D Class Ghosts SCP-4973

00:20:47.129 --> 00:20:52.000
- Dead Men Walking” for more ominous hauntings
that keep the horrors of the past alive and

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:52.030
well!

